h-p-2600.jpg 2600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/68d6fb3651f20e86493acc72_BrawlStars_Quest%20Home%20-%20Janice%20Hsieh.jpg 2640w" class="card-case-image"/><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/6800f49705d9e5875c132006_Bg_2.png" alt="" class="card-bg-case"/></div></a><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Mobile Video Quest</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Gaming</div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="card-wr-case w-dyn-item"><a href="/quests-success-stories/walmart-skyward" class="link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div data-w-id="20204a10-e1e5-c06e-5d05-0f2552027841" class="link-block-games is-up-26"><div class="link-block-content-wr"><div class="tag-game is-up-26"><div class="z-index-3">Walmart Skyward Video Quest</div></div><p class="body-text-new--xll text-style-3lines">With the goal of connecting with the gaming community, Walmart becomes the first brand to use Video Quests to bring players into its own custom Discord server experience, complete with an exclusive in-game reward.</p><div class="item-category-name">This is some text inside of a div block.</div></div><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/68c989ebaae868c512fbd59e_68b9fa3ae48ed8a9e8cd4829_Discord_Hero%20-%20Walmart%20Skyward%20UPDATED%20copy.png" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/68c989ebaae868c512fbd59e_68b9fa3ae48ed8a9e8cd4829_Discord_Hero%20-%20Walmart%20Skyward%20UPDATED%20copy-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/68c989ebaae868c512fbd59e_68b9fa3ae48ed8a9e8cd4829_Discord_Hero%20-%20Walmart%20Skyward%20UPDATED%20copy.png 619w" class="card-case-image"/><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/6800f49705d9e5875c132006_Bg_2.png" alt="" class="card-bg-case"/></div></a><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">General Market</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Video Quest</div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="card-wr-case w-dyn-item"><a href="/quests-success-stories/world-of-warcraft-mountain-dew" class="link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div data-w-id="20204a10-e1e5-c06e-5d05-0f2552027841" class="link-block-games is-up-26"><div class="link-block-content-wr"><div class="tag-game is-up-26"><div class="z-index-3">World of Warcraft x Mountain Dew: Crown of the Violet Rose</div></div><p class="body-text-new--xll text-style-3lines">Mountain Dew pioneered the first Discord Quest by a consumer food &amp; beverage brand, partnering with World of Warcraft to organically engage Gen Z players.</p><div class="item-category-name">This is some text inside of a div block.</div></div><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/68a39f7efb5badf3ea4930a9_Quest%20Bar%20BG%20Image_860x860.jpg" alt="" class="card-case-image"/><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/6800f49705d9e5875c132006_Bg_2.png" alt="" class="card-bg-case"/></div></a><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Play Quest</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">General Market</div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="card-wr-case w-dyn-item"><a href="/quests-success-stories/dune-prophecy" class="link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div data-w-id="20204a10-e1e5-c06e-5d05-0f2552027841" class="link-block-games is-up-26"><div class="link-block-content-wr"><div class="tag-game is-up-26"><div class="z-index-3">Dune Prophecy</div></div><p class="body-text-new--xll text-style-3lines">To support the launch of Dune: Prophecy, Max teamed up with Discord to launch the first ever Video Quest to drive awareness and engagement for the TV series. </p><div class="item-category-name">This is some text inside of a div block.</div></div><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/6800c9201eaadfd8ff06b4a2_Dune%20Prophecy.png" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/6800c9201eaadfd8ff06b4a2_Dune%20Prophecy-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/6800c9201eaadfd8ff06b4a2_Dune%20Prophecy.png 644w" class="card-case-image"/><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/6800f49705d9e5875c132006_Bg_2.png" alt="" class="card-bg-case"/></div></a><div class="hide w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Video Quest</div></div><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="item-category-name">Media &amp; Entertainment</div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="card-wr-case w-dyn-item"><a href="/quests-success-stories/supervive" class="link-block-wrapper w-inline-block"><div data-w-id="20204a10-e1e5-c06e-5d05-0f2552027841" class="link-block-games is-up-26"><div class="link-block-content-wr"><div class="tag-game is-up-26"><div class="z-index-3">Supervive</div></div><p class="body-text-new--xll text-style-3lines">To support the launch of SUPERVIVE, Theorycraft Games teamed up with Discord in a comprehensive partnership, including integrating Discord’s Social SDK to enhance social gameplay, and launching a Play Quest to drive discovery, and player growth.</p><div class="item-category-name">This is some text inside of a div block.</div></div><img loading="eager" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/625fe439fb70a9d901e138ab/6800c